                "title": "Beverly Hills Egg Knob Entrance Set",
                "description": "The Beverly Hills Entrance Set is a great way to add a touch of sophisticated beauty to your home. It features an elegant mixture of traditional design with just enough modern flair that it will look great on any front door. It has an egg-shaped knob that adds a point of interest to the handleset. This front door lock will fit door 1-3/4 inches thick to 2 inches thick. Choose from an array of stunning finishes.\r\n",
